### Step 1: Create materialized view

Source: https://github.com/514-labs/moosestack/blob/main/apps/framework-docs-v2/content/guides/static-report-generation.mdx

Materialized views in MooseStack automatically aggregate data during the ingestion process. By grouping transactions into summarized records, such as daily totals, the system collapses large datasets into smaller, more efficient tables. Because these views aggregate data per batch, it is necessary to include a GROUP BY clause when querying the resulting materialized view tables.

