### Create a Materialized View for Data Migration

Source: https://github.com/514-labs/moosestack/blob/main/apps/framework-docs-v2/content/moosestack/olap/schema-versioning.mdx

Defines a materialized view to migrate data from an existing table to a new versioned target table. Ensure the targetTable is an instance of an OlapTable to maintain versioning.

```typescript
import { MaterializedView, sql } from "@514labs/moose-lib";
import { events } from "../tables/events";        // old table
import { eventsV1, EventV1 } from "../tables/events_v01";  // new versioned table

export const migrateEventsToV01 = new MaterializedView<EventV1>({
  materializedViewName: "mv_events_to_0_1",
  selectTables: [events],
  selectStatement: sql.statement`
    SELECT * FROM ${events}
  `,
  targetTable: eventsV1,
});
```

```python
